{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415705","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415705","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041570501:0":{"text":"당신이 저들이 말한 군신 브루투스입니까?","source_cn":"你就是他们说的战神，布鲁特斯？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3878DEE9A94A5967","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041570502:0":{"text":"신처럼 보이지는 않는군요.","source_cn":"你一点也不像神明。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E61292169DBB388","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041570503:0":{"text":"오, 그래? 신은 어떻게 생겨야 하지?","source_cn":"哦？你觉得神应该是什么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48EFC5D84922A050","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041570504:0":{"text":"신에 대해서 많이 아는 건 아닙니다.","source_cn":"我见过的神不多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FC32D001AE67528","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041570505:1":{"text":"하지만 저희 동족들이 믿는 신은... 피를 갈망하고 오만하며, 신도들을 업신여겼습니다.","source_cn":"但我同族所信仰的神明……嗜血，傲慢，蔑视信徒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD7DE4CE2F0C9175","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041570506:1":{"text":"젊은이, 눈에 증오가 가득 차 있군.","source_cn":"年轻人，我看得出你眼中充斥着仇恨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F77E29CE93C5B03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041570507:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041570508:1":{"text":"그렇게 긴장하지 말게. 소위 “군신”이라는 것은 그저 명예로운 칭호일 뿐이니까.","source_cn":"放松点吧。所谓之“战神”，不过是一个荣耀的称号。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D504932C0B5734E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041570509:1":{"text":"언젠가는 나를 이긴 자가 이 칭호를 계승할 걸세.","source_cn":"终有一日，这个称号会由击败我的人继承。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8166895E4F179431","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041570510:1":{"text":"보아하니 아주 훌륭한 전사인 것 같군. 시련을 통과하고 군가 축제에서 정정당당하게 나와 맞선다면 이 칭호가 자네에게 갈 수도 있겠지.","source_cn":"看得出你是一名优秀的战士。若是你能通过试炼，在战歌节上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x110610C3BF198315","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041570511:1":{"text":"시련? 축제? 거기선 뭘 하는 겁니까?","source_cn":"试炼？节日？！……你们要做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43ADD54CDA06B9B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041570512:1":{"text":"무예를 겨루고 험난한 시련의 수수께끼를 지혜로 풀어나가며, 필요하다면 상대와 협력하기도 하지.","source_cn":"切磋武艺，挑战天险，用智慧破解谜题，必要时与对手合作。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4949CDCDAF6B0CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041570513:1":{"text":"왜 그렇게 긴장한 거지?","source_cn":"你为什么这么紧张？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E621B6F9E55CF5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041570514:1":{"text":"...그것뿐입니까?","source_cn":"……只有你说的这些？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1C599BFB3E83BE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041570515:1":{"text":"이것만으로도 충분하지 않나.","source_cn":"这已经非常全面。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A54CDDE150084E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041570516:1":{"text":"그 외에 전사가 또 무엇을 증명해야 한다고 생각하지?","source_cn":"除了这些，你觉得战士还需要什么样的证明？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EBD10DA902E6832","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041570517:1":{"text":"...아니요, 없습니다. 여러분의 문화를 잘 몰라서 물어본 것뿐입니다.","source_cn":"……不，不需要。我只是不了解你们的习俗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB269DDC52E81CA79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041570518:1":{"text":"하하, 그럼 이제 알게 된 셈이군.","source_cn":"哈哈，那你现在了解了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33CE853EA9EDE407","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041570519:1":{"text":"젊은이, 자네의 도전장을 받을 날을 기대하고 있겠네.","source_cn":"我很期待你向我发起挑战的那一天，年轻人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC32F4374EC3183E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:那非":{"text":"나페이","source":"那非","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布鲁特斯":{"text":"브루투스","source":"布鲁特斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":2}}